\b AirenoOS AutoCAD Plugin\b0\par
\par
Copyright \'a9 2026 AirenoOS. All rights reserved.\par
\par
This plugin extracts drawing metadata from AutoCAD documents and synchronizes it with the AirenoOS MCP backend.\par
\par
\b Permitted use:\b0\par
- Internal use by the licensed organization.\par
- Diagnostic logging to local %TEMP%\\AirenoOS\\ folders.\par
- Outbound HTTPS calls to the endpoint configured by the AIRENO_CONNECT command.\par
